#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Technical Overview"
msgstr "ទិដ្ឋភាពទូទៅ​នៃ​បច្ចេកទេស​"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter aims to give a technical overview of &kdeprint; which "
"non-programmers can comprehend."
msgstr "គោលដៅ​នៃ​ជំពូក​នេះ​ផ្តល់​ទិដ្ឋភាព​ទូទៅ​បច្ចេកទេស​នៃ kdeprint ​ដែលមិនមែនជា​អ្នក​សរសេរ​កម្មវិធី​មិន​អាច​យល់​ច្បាស់​ឡើយ​ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is a new and revolutionary tool to give easy access to printing "
"services for both &kde; users and &kde; developers."
msgstr ""
"kdeprint ជាឧបករណ៍​បដិវត្តន៍​ថ្មី​ដែល​បាន​ផ្តល់​ឲ្យ​យ៉ាងងាយ "
"ស្រួល​ដើម្បី​ចូល​ដំណើរការ​សេវា​បោះពុម្ព ទាំង​អ្នកប្រើ​ និង​អ្នក "
"អភិវឌ្ឍន​ kde ។​"

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Brief Description of &kdeprint;"
msgstr "ការពិពណ៌នា​សង្ខេប​នៃ​ kdeprint"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can access the functions of &kdeprint; in different ways: through the "
"Printing Manger in the &kcontrol;, through the <command>kprinter</command> "
"command or through the dialog that pops up if you want to print."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកអាច​ចូល​ដំណើរការ​មុខងារ​របស់​ kdeprint តាម​វិធី​ផ្សេងៗគ្នា​ ៖  តាម​ការ​បោះពុម្ព​ក្នុង​ kcontrol ដោយ​ប្រើ​ពាក្យបញ្ជា​ <command>kprinter</command> "
"ឬ​តាម​ប្រអប់​លេចឡើង​បើ​អ្នក​ចង់បោះពុម្ព ។"

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "What it is <emphasis>not</emphasis>"
msgstr "ើ​វា​មិនមែន​ <emphasis>ជា​</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is <emphasis>not</emphasis> a replacement for the printing subsystem "
"itself. &kdeprint; does <emphasis>not</emphasis> therefore give provision for "
"spooling, and it does <emphasis>not</emphasis> do the basic processing of "
"&PostScript; or other print data."
msgstr ""
"kdeprint វា​មិន​ <emphasis> អាចនជា​ </emphasis> ជំនួស​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ការបោះពុម្ព​រង​ដោយ​ខ្លូន​វា​បានទេ​ ។​ kdeprnoes "
"<emphasis> ពុំ​បាន​ </emphasis> ផ្តល់​នូវ​"
"វត្ថុ​បម្រុង​ទុកសម្រាប់ស្នូល ហើយ​វា​"
" <emphasis> មិន </emphasis> មែន​ជា​ដំណើរការ​មូលដ្ឋាន​នៃ​"
"PostScrp ឬ​ទិន្នន័យ​បោះពុម្ព​ផ្សេងទៀត​ឡើយ​ ។"

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "What it <emphasis>is</emphasis>"
msgstr "តើ​ <emphasis> វាជា​អ្វី​ </emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is an intermediate layer between the spooling and the data "
"processing print subsystem (as installed), and the application that seeks to "
"print. &kdeprint; provides a common interface for &kde; developers and &kde; "
"users, to various supported print subsystems. At the same time, it is "
"customizable, and highly configurable."
msgstr ""
"kdeprint ជាស្រទាប់​មធ្យម​​រវាង​ស្នូល​ និង​ដំណើរការ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​បោះពុម្ព​ទិន្នន័យ​រង​ (បានដំឡើង​) និង​កម្មវិធី​ដែល​រក​មើល​ដើម្បី​"
"បោះពុម្ព ។ kdeprint ផ្តល់​នូវ​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់​យ៉ាងងាយ​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន​​និង​អ្នកប្រើ​របស់​ kde ដែល​បានគាំទ្រ​ប្រព័ន្ធ "
"​បោះពុម្ព​រងខុសៗគ្នា ។ ក្នុង​ពេលតែ​មួយ​ វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្តូរ​តាម​ចិត្ត​ និង​អាច​កំណត់​រចនាសម្ព័ន្ថ​បាន​ច្រើនទៀត​ផង​ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; is easy to use for both &kde; developers and end-users. Developers "
"can port their applications, with minimal changes, to use &kdeprint; instead of "
"the old &Qt; print <quote>system</quote>. Users can easily choose and configure "
"their print subsystem."
msgstr ""
"kdeprint ងាយស្រួ​ល​ក្នុង​ការប្រើ​ទាំង​អ្នកប្រើ​ និង​អ្នកអភិវឌ្ឍន​"
"របស់​ kde ។ អ្នក​អភិវឌ្ឍន​អាច​ច្រក​កម្មវិធី​របស់​ពួក​គេ​"
"ជាមួយ​ការផ្លាស់ប្តូរអប្បរមា​ ដើម្បីប្រើ​ kdeprint ជំនួស​"
"ប្រព័ន្ធ​  <quote> បោះពុម្ព </quote> QTចាស់ៗ ។ "
"អ្នកប្រើ​ងាយស្រួល​អាច​ជ្រើស​រើស​ ហើយ​កំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ "
"ប្រព័ន្ធ​បោះពុម្ពរង​របស់​ពួកគេ​ ។​"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a reference to new &kde; users: &Qt; is the basic library and graphical "
"toolkit, which is used by all &kde; applications; &Qt; is developed by "
"TrollTech, a Norwegian software company."
msgstr ""
"ចំពោះ​សេចក្តីយោង​អ្នកប្រើ​ kde ថ្មី​ ៖ Qt ជា​បណ្តាល័យមូលដ្ឋាន​ និង​ក្រាហ្វិក​ toolkit ដែល​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ដោយ​កម្មវិធី​ទាំងអស់​របស់​kde ហើយ​ Qt ត្រូវ​បាន​អភិវឌ្ឍន​ដោយ​"
"TrollTech, ជាក្រុមហ៊ុន​ផលិត​កម្មវិធី​នៃ​ប្រទេស​ Norwegian  ។"

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdeprint; -- Different Usage for Different People"
msgstr "kdeprint -- ការប្រើ​ខុសគ្នា ចំពោះ​អ្នកប្រើ​ខុសគ្នា​"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdeprint; has different faces for different people."
msgstr "kdeprint មាន​ផ្ទៃមុខ​ខុសគ្នា​ ចំពោះ​មនុស្ស​ខុសគ្នា ។​"

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "What users and administrators can do with &kdeprint;"
msgstr "តើ​អ្នកប្រើ​ និង​អ្នកគ្រប់គ្រង​អាច​ធ្វើ​អ្វី​បាន​ខ្លះ​ជាមួ​យ kdeprint ។"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint; allows users and/or administrators, depending on their rights, "
"access to printing subsystems (&CUPS;, <acronym>LPD</acronym>, <acronym>"
"RLPR</acronym>, <application>LPRng</application>, <application>PDQ</application> "
"&etc;) through a &kde; graphical user interface (&GUI;). Using &kdeprint;, they "
"can print, administer jobs, printers and the printing daemon, all in a "
"comfortable manner."
msgstr ""
"kdeprint អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នកប្រើ ឬ​អ្នកគ្រប់គ្រង​"
"ពឹងផ្នែកលើសិទ្ធ​របស់​ចូលដំណើរការ​ប្រព័ន្ធ​ការបោះពុម្ពរង​"
"របស់​ពួកគេ​ (CUPS <acronym>LPD</acronym>, <acronym>"
"RLPR</acronym> <application>LPRng</application>, <application>PDQ</application> "
"&etc;) កាត់​តាម​ចំណុច​ប្រទាក់អ្នកប្រើក្រាហ្វិករបស់​ kde  (GUI) ។​ ការប្រើ kdeprint ពួក​គេអាចបោះពុម្ព​"
"ការងារ​អ្នកគ្រប់គ្រង ម៉ាស៊ីន​បោះពុម្ព​ និង​ការបោះពុម្ព "
"ទាំងអស់​ក្នុង​ឥរិបាបទ​មួយ​ដ៏​ងាយស្រួល​។"

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Experienced users will like the capability to plug any working filter for the "
"print data between the output of their application and the input, into the "
"chosen print subsystem. Some examples for this already ship with <quote>"
"plain vanilla</quote> &kdeprint;. Read on."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកប្រើ​ដែល​មានបទពិសោធន៍​​​Experienced users will like the capability to plug any working filter for the print data between the output of their application and the input, into the "
"chosen print subsystem. Some examples for this already ship with <quote>"
"plain vanilla</quote> &kdeprint;. Read on."

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "What &kde; developers can do with it..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a &kde; developer needs printing access for his application, he does not "
"code the printing functions from scratch. Before &kde; 2.2 this service was "
"provided by the <classname>QPrinter</classname> class, a library function of "
"the &Qt; Toolkit. The <classname>QPrinter</classname> "
"class relied on the out-moded <quote>Line Printer Daemon</quote> (<acronym>"
"LPD</acronym>). The &kdeprint; library bases itself firmly on the more modern "
"Common &UNIX; Printing System (&CUPS;), while at the same time keeping backward "
"compatibility with <acronym>LPD</acronym> and other legacy, or less elaborate, "
"print systems. It also <quote>leaves the door open</quote> "
"for any new development that might occur."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For &kde; developers to use the new &kdeprint; class in their applications, "
"they require only minimal changes to their code: for every call of <classname>"
"QPrinter</classname>, they just need to change this to <classname>"
"KPrinter</classname>. Replacing one (!) letter in a few spots, and "
"automatically they are done; their application can then use all of the features "
"of the new &kdeprint; library."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More ambitious developers, or ones with special requirements, can do more: "
"despite &kdeprint;'s feature-rich framework, they are still able to customize "
"the print dialog of their application by creating an additional <quote>"
"Tab</quote>, where their extensions to the standard &kdeprint; will feel right "
"at home."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This last mentioned feature has not been used widely inside &kde; so far, as "
"developers are not yet fully aware of &kdeprint;'s power. Expect more of this "
"in the near future. One example I discovered is the &kcron; application. It "
"lets you edit the crontab through a &GUI;. The developers have implemented a "
"printing feature that lets you (or <systemitem class=\"username\">"
"root</systemitem>) choose if you want to print the whole of crontab (for all "
"users) or just the part that is marked. You can see the effects on &kdeprint; "
"in the following screenshots."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "This shot shows a sample from the &kcron; utility."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tech-overview.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcron; utility: a small sample of a system's cronjobs as shown through the "
"&kde; <acronym>GUI</acronym>&GUI;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: tech-overview.docbook:122
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &kcron; developers let you choose to print the whole of the cron table or "
"just the marked part of it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The dialog to configure &kcron;'s printing options: the additional tab titled "
"<guilabel>Cron Options</guilabel> is from inside &kcron;, not &kdeprint;; it is "
"a special extension added by the &kcron; developers for printing purposes, not "
"originating from, but executed by &kdeprint;. Developers of other applications "
"are free to implement their own goodies, if they feel need for it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tech-overview.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>&kcron;'s addition to the &kdeprint; dialog.</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: tech-overview.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&kcron;'s addition to the &kdeprint; dialog.</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>&kcron;'s addition to the &kdeprint; dialog.</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "What &kdeprint; offers to everybody..."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdeprint;'s easy-to-use interface for all supported print subsystems of course "
"does not eliminate basic traditional weaknesses of some of those systems. But "
"it smooths some rough edges. Different users may use different printing systems "
"on the same box. A user is free to even switch <quote>on the fly</quote>"
", from the print dialog, the print subsystem to be used for the next job. (This "
"is possible if different systems are installed in a way that they don't <quote>"
"get in each other's way</quote>.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most &UNIX; users are used to <acronym>LPD</acronym> printing. <acronym>"
"LPD</acronym> provides only basic printing functions, is very inflexible and "
"does not utilize the many options of more modern print systems like &CUPS;. "
"While also working remotely over any distance (like every TCP/IP based "
"protocol), <acronym>LPD</acronym> lacks bi-directional communication, "
"authentication, access control and encryption support."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kdeprint; can use &CUPS; to support:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "Querying the <acronym>LAN</acronym> for available printers,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic, Digest, and Certificate Authentication,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Access Control based on <acronym>IP</acronym> addresses, net addresses, "
"netmasks, host- and domain names,"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"and 128-Bit TLS or SSL3 encryption of print data, to prevent eavesdropping, or "
"at least make it much more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This makes &kdeprint; a much more robust and reliable solution than using the "
"venerable <acronym>LPD</acronym>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: tech-overview.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to access &kdeprint;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "You get access to &kdeprint;, or parts of it, in four different ways:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"through your applications: if you call the printing dialog (either <menuchoice>"
"<guilabel>File</guilabel> <guilabel>Print...</guilabel></menuchoice>"
") or the button with the little printer icon on it; this opens the printing "
"dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"through the typed command <command>kprinter</command> in a <application>"
"terminal</application> or a &konsole; window or from the <guilabel>"
"Run Command...</guilabel> mini-<acronym>CLI</acronym> "
"window: this also opens the printing dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"from the <inlinemediaobject><imageobject> <imagedata "
"fileref=\"kcontrol-icon.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> button, starting &kcontrol;, and then go to <menuchoice>"
"<guilabel>System</guilabel><guilabel>Printing Manager</guilabel></menuchoice>"
". This opens the &kdeprint; administration which is part of the "
"&kcontrolcenter; and also lets you switch to other parts of the &kcontrol;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"from a command line (&konsole; or mini-<acronym>CLI</acronym>) type <userinput> "
"<command>kcmshell</command> <option>printers</option></userinput>"
". This opens just the &kdeprint; part of &kcontrol; to change your settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: tech-overview.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kprinter; dialog to be started from <guilabel>Run Command...</guilabel> window"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: tech-overview.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>Starting the &kprinter; dialog from a <guilabel>"
"Run Command...</guilabel> window.</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: tech-overview.docbook:236
